"""analysis.py -- dependency-free analysis/statistics package for the
experiment protocol "Does scale necessarily win? (llama-2-13b vs llama-2-70b)".

This file is NOT an experiment and contains NO experiment results. It is the
pure-Python analysis + statistics layer of the *design*: (1) paired size-gaps
