superiority/negation decisions, (4) linear model score ~ alpha*size +
beta*log(tok/param) + gamma*alignment (+ interaction) and the *derived*
negation boundary with bootstrap uncertainty.

Python stdlib only (no numpy/scipy/torch) so it runs offline.

Results-table JSON schema (see synthetic_data.py for a generator):
{"meta": {...},
 "rows": [{"cell": "adequate_rlhf", "size": "13b"|"70b",
